    "parsing_res_list": [
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "甲乙方双方本着平等自愿、诚实信用、协商一致的原则，就双方订立固定期限劳动合同事宜达成如下协议",
            "block_bbox": [
                73,
                98,
                1363,
                168
            ],
            "block_id": 0,
            "block_order": 1
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "page (the \"Employee\").\n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                75,
                184,
                1541,
                397
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a to conclude a fixed-term employment agreement as follows:",
            "block_bbox": [
                77,
                439,
                1575,
                578
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "1 聘用期限 Employment Period ",
            "block_bbox": [
                80,
                631,
                498,
                666
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1.1聘用期为2025-06-01日至2029-05-31日。",
            "block_bbox": [
                118,
                720,
                715,
                749
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The employment period is from_06 01,2025_(MM DD, YYYY) to_05 31,2029_(MM DD, YYYY).",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                772,
                1295,
                803
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1.2聘用期限届满甲方希望继续聘用乙方的，双方在本聘用期限届满前另行协商订立新的聘用协议。",
            "block_bbox": [
                116,
                839,
                1306,
                867
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Should Companywishesto extendtheemloyment piodupon the trmiatiooftheAeement,thetwo parties will signanewmploymntaeemntthroughotiatiobforethtrmiatioofthisArement.Companisfreefrom any liability for failure to extend the employment period due to reasons of the Employee.",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                889,
                1585,
                1030
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "2工作内容 Work Content ",
            "block_bbox": [
                76,
                1087,
                419,
                1118
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2.1甲方聘用乙方主要从事研发族方面内容的工作。乙方同意甲方有权根据业务需要调整乙方工作岗位。乙方同意工作岗位调整后的薪酬待遇按调整后的工作岗位相关薪酬标准确定。\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                114,
                1172,
                1587,
                1258
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Company employs the Employee to mainly engage in_R&D Familyrelated work.The Employee agrees that Company benefits according to the pay standard of the new position.\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                112,
                1281,
                1591,
                1417
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2.2乙方不胜任工作的，甲方有权对乙方工作岗位进行调整，调整后乙方仍不胜任的，甲方有权解除聘用协议。",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                1451,
                1462,
                1480
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "may terminate the Agreement if the Employee proves incompetent for the new position.\n\n",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                1506,
                1592,
                1592
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2.3在聘用期间，乙方工作岗位的调整，不影响本协议效力。",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                1624,
                848,
                1654
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Change in the position of the Employee within the employment period shall not affect the effectiveness of this Agrement ",
            "block_bbox": [
                110,
                1680,
                1592,
                1710
            ],
            "block_id": 14,
            "block_order": 15
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "3试用期Probation Period ",
            "block_bbox": [
                68,
                1763,
                444,
                1796
            ],
            "block_id": 15,
            "block_order": 16
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.1双方同意按照以下第a种方式确定试用期。",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                1858,
                750,
                1886
            ],
            "block_id": 16,
            "block_order": 17
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Both Company and the Employee agree to determine the probation period in mode_a ",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                1912,
                1208,
                1946
            ],
            "block_id": 17,
            "block_order": 18
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(a)无试用期。No probation period.",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                1974,
                584,
                2007
            ],
            "block_id": 18,
            "block_order": 19
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b)试用期为_天。A probation period of___day(s).",
            "block_bbox": [
                107,
                2035,
                787,
                2075
            ],
            "block_id": 19,
            "block_order": 20
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3.2试用期包含在聘用期之内。",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                2099,
                497,
                2132
            ],
            "block_id": 20,
            "block_order": 21
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The probation period is included in the employment period.",
